| **C1** | **S1 extracts from the CER-4 close-out (T1), never from the 10-point audit (T2).** T2 may contribute `status` and `Component` only. | Determines the verdict outright: 0.27 vs 0.50. T2 asserts "zero technical debt" for a goal containing the corpus's only complete Scar (§4). Pointing the extractor at T2 falsifies A8. | Zero — a source-selection line in the extractor. |
