                   │    EnvelopeBinder    │  mints id, sets namespace/status=candidate,
                   └──────────┬───────────┘  computes source_hash; NEVER sets confidence
                              ▼
                   ┌──────────────────────┐
                   │  CompletenessGate    │  scores each cell E/P/A; refuses fabrication
                   └──────────┬───────────┘  emits absent as explicit null + reason
                              ▼
                   ┌──────────────────────┐
                   │   OutboxWriter       │  append-only, in-repo
                   └──────────┬───────────┘
                              ╎  pull, never push (§6.1b rule 1)
                              ▼
                        SAKG ingest
```

**Boundary invariants preserved.** One-way, post-seal, pull-based (§6.1b r1);
evidence never leaves, only hashes cross (r2); namespace set by the producer
(r4). The extractor is a *reader* of PAEOS and a *writer* of the outbox only —
K8 single-writer holds on both sides of the boundary.

